# n8n main and worker pods write to ~/.n8n, /tmp, and caches at runtime, requiring a writable filesystem
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0014 (Root file system is not read-only)
KSV-0014
AVD-KSV-0014

# Helm test hook (Pod-n8n-test-connection.yaml) is an ephemeral test pod generated by upstream chart tests/
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0118 (Default security context configured)
KSV-0118
AVD-KSV-0118

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0001 (Can elevate its own privileges)
